### Task 7: Author the prose-stability classifier migration script

**Files:**
- Create: `scripts/migrate/classify-prose-stability.ts`
- Create: `scripts/migrate/__tests__/classify-prose-stability.test.ts`

**Classifier rules.**

- `stub`: any required section has trimmed content ≤ 50 characters, **or** any section's markdown body contains (case-insensitive) any of `TODO`, `TBD`, `FIXME`, `placeholder`, `lorem ipsum`.
- `draft`: record schema-validates, has all required sections, every required section has > 50 chars trimmed content, no placeholder markers anywhere. Default for well-formed content that hasn't been editorially promoted.
- `canonical`: **NEVER assigned by the classifier.** Promotion to canonical is manual editorial work (happens in §6 / §8 of the umbrella plan).

Rationale: the migration establishes an honest baseline without falsely promoting content. Canonical is earned, not inferred.

